10
00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:04.050
Mitigation strategy. Say it with me. Mitigation strategy!

11
00:01:07.577 --> 00:01:12.310
Adaptation measure. Say it with me. Adaptation measure!

12
00:01:15.799 --> 00:01:20.565
Youth climate movement. Say it with me. Youth climate movement!

13
00:01:24.055 --> 00:01:28.739
Emission reduction. Say it with me. Emission reduction!

14
00:01:32.212 --> 00:01:38.512
