17
00:02:00.823 --> 00:02:10.178
Grammar time! Unless clauses. Listen. Unless we act now, climate change will worsen.

18
00:02:10.228 --> 00:02:16.282
Your turn. Say it with me. Unless we act now, climate change will worsen.

19
00:02:21.126 --> 00:02:32.253
Renewable transition and carbon tax policies support climate mitigation. Youth climate movements push for global cooperation and environmental accountability.

20
00:02:32.303 --> 00:02:33.879
I like this story!

21
00:02:35.004 --> 00:02:40.280
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:42.118
Renewable transition!

23
00:02:43.139 --> 00:02:48.096
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:48.146 --> 00:02:49.640
Adaptation measure!

25
00:02:50.698 --> 00:02:59.936
Think and answer. What climate action do you think is most urgent right now?

26
